/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  constant/economics -- the prices this appraisal is priced at.  Currency:
  EUR per kg of the stream named.

  EVERY PRICE BELOW IS AN AUTHOR-SET ASSUMPTION and none cites a source,
  because none was read.  They are round figures chosen so that the appraisal
  can run, NOT market data: a group replaces each with a dated, cited figure
  (a supplier quotation, a tender price) before quoting an NPV.  The
  provenance block of each says so, in the words the engine carries to its
  output.

  THE TWO PRICES THAT DECIDE THE APPRAISAL:
    * the API, BOUGHT: 10 000 EUR/kg of apalutamide.  The 60 mg in a tablet
      then costs 0.60 EUR;
    * the TABLET, SOLD: 1.00 EUR per tablet ex-factory.  The stream
      `packagedTablets` carries 7.5989 kg/h for 12 672 tablets/h (0.5997 g a
      tablet, the core, the coat and the water the coat keeps), so the price
      per kg of that stream is 12 672 / 7.5989 = 1667.6 EUR/kg.  If the
      formulation, the coat or the reject fraction moves, so does the tablet
      mass: redo this division (it does not follow the run).

  NOT PRICED: the purge gas (to vent treatment, not modelled), the coating
  exhaust (to atmosphere through a filter, not modelled) and the rejected
  tablets (their disposal is a cost the plant does not carry here).
  The UTILITIES (steam, cooling water, ammonia refrigeration, the blower's
  electricity) are priced from their records by the utility allocation.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
products
(
    {
        stream    packagedTablets;
        price     1667.6;             // EUR/kg = 1.00 EUR/tablet, see header
        costYear  2026;
        provenance
        {
            origin  "author-set assumption (DEV.md 4c C97), not a market price";
            method  "1.00 EUR per tablet ex-factory, a round figure; replace with a dated, cited price";
        }
    }
    {
        stream    recoveredAcetone;   // reused after QC, valued below fresh
        price     0.80;               // EUR/kg -- AUTHOR-SET
        costYear  2026;
        provenance
        {
            origin  "author-set assumption (DEV.md 4c C97), not a market price";
            method  "two thirds of the fresh-acetone price: recovered solvent, reused after testing";
        }
    }
);
rawMaterials
